Raw Fitness Health Club is officially open! 🎉

Here’s a look at our grand opening — and the moment leading up to it. 🙏🏼

This moment has been 10 years in the making. From our humble beginnings training outdoors to running a small personal training studio in Port Credit, to now launching a 10,000 sq. ft. state-of-the-art facility, we couldn’t be more grateful for the love and support from our incredible community.

The journey hasn’t been easy, but every challenge has deepened our passion for health and fitness — and we can’t wait to share that passion with you.

Membership details are available at rawfitinc.com. We’re running massive opening sales, but spots are limited to keep our gym comfortable and uncrowded. Secure your membership today and be part of Mississauga’s best fitness experience. ⚡️

Thank you to all the vendors and individuals who helped us bring this vision to life, supported us through the chaos, and made our grand opening unforgettable.

